  "readmeFile": "Package.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Reconciles the two divergent 1.x lines (1.0.0 and the since-unlisted 1.1.0) into one API surface.\nAdded: OAuth authentication over the control channel for headless/cross-device login (ClaudeCodeQuery.AuthenticateAsync/SubmitOAuthCallbackAsync/WaitForOAuthCompletionAsync).\nAdded: remote MCP server support (SSE/HTTP), persisted permission rules, turn-aborting denials, and additional hook events/result fields.\nFixed: ResultMessage.ModelUsage and ModelUsageInfo.ApiProvider were bound to the wrong wire keys and always deserialized as null.\nSecurity: refuse to spawn .bat/.cmd CLI shims and reject cmd.exe metacharacters in argument values on Windows.\nImproved: bounded stdout buffering and safer process disposal/cleanup.\nBreaking vs 1.0.0: ToolPermissionDecision.Allow/Deny gained additional parameters (recompile required). Agents/JsonSchema-typed members are unchanged from 1.0.0 (still Universal.Common.Json.JsonSchema/AgentDefinition, not JObject).",
